WEBVTT

00:02:02.766 --> 00:02:03.796
How awful...

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:06.230
This is how they do things.

00:02:06.733 --> 00:02:09.103
You can't let it bother you
every time you see it.

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:12.470
It's completely destroyed.

00:02:14.333 --> 00:02:16.903
The whole town probably resisted.

00:02:19.100 --> 00:02:20.430
Where are the townspeople?

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:23.170
They were probably taken away.

00:02:24.033 --> 00:02:27.333
I want information. Jiro,
let's check out the area.

00:02:27.900 --> 00:02:29.770
Then leave it to me!

00:02:34.433 --> 00:02:35.633
What are you planning to do?

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:41.370
If I fix it a bit, we might be able
to get some information.

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:47.030
UNDERWEAR IS
THE TRUMP CARD

00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:54.070
Now it should be okay.

00:02:58.666 --> 00:03:02.326
Third Army group...mechanized
infantry force member.

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:06.670
ID code H13#005761.

00:03:07.166 --> 00:03:09.896
Initializing memory
analysis mode display.

00:03:12.666 --> 00:03:13.866
I did it.

00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:16.130
Awesome!

00:03:26.466 --> 00:03:28.626
It's the jerks from
the Grankingdom.

00:03:28.766 --> 00:03:29.766
Damn it.

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:35.170
What are those?

00:03:35.666 --> 00:03:36.326
Shadows?

00:03:39.466 --> 00:03:40.126
Is it an enemy?

00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:40.970
Where are they?!

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:45.370
Who did that?! I just fixed it!

00:03:47.333 --> 00:03:49.503
You're bad guys, maro!

00:03:49.766 --> 00:03:50.766
Who are you?!

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:55.570
Is it a cat?

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:57.730
No, he's a member of
the Devee Tribe.

00:03:58.133 --> 00:03:59.233
The Devee Tribe?

00:03:59.533 --> 00:04:01.903
You guys messed up this town.

00:04:02.366 --> 00:04:04.566
You're bad guys!
I'll defeat you!

00:04:16.533 --> 00:04:17.203
A Shadow?

00:04:17.333 --> 00:04:18.703
That little guy's got one too?

00:04:22.933 --> 00:04:25.803
Marumaro, I feel your anger.

00:04:26.266 --> 00:04:28.696
Apparently, it's not
a prank this time.

00:04:28.733 --> 00:04:31.373
That's right!
They're bad guys, maro!

00:04:33.366 --> 00:04:36.796
The girls in this town were pretty.

00:04:37.166 --> 00:04:38.796
Th-The girls?

00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:40.700
Marumaro...

00:04:41.033 --> 00:04:44.233
Oh, I mean...
I liked this town!

00:04:44.266 --> 00:04:46.696
I'd gotten lost and
they were nice to me!

00:04:46.966 --> 00:04:49.896
You're friends with the robot
that destroyed the town!

00:04:49.933 --> 00:04:51.503
For that,
you will be punished, maro!

00:04:51.533 --> 00:04:54.533
Just a minute! It wasn't us!

00:04:54.566 --> 00:04:56.896
Okay, you have my support!

00:04:57.700 --> 00:05:00.570
I'll become the fangs to
defeat those guys

00:05:01.033 --> 00:05:03.503
and deal out
a crushing blow of justice!

00:05:03.633 --> 00:05:05.373
They're not listening...

00:05:05.766 --> 00:05:07.426
Let's go, Saber Tiger!

00:05:07.833 --> 00:05:09.333
Let's go, Marumaro!

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:11.700
For our justice!

00:05:13.166 --> 00:05:14.166
Justice?

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:16.500
Hey, don't get all fired up
on your own!

00:05:16.833 --> 00:05:17.973
We're...

00:05:18.166 --> 00:05:20.966
They don't seem to be the kind of people
who like to talk things over.

00:05:43.133 --> 00:05:45.033
Maroooo!

00:05:49.433 --> 00:05:50.433
What?!

00:05:50.466 --> 00:05:51.466
He's fast!

00:06:06.466 --> 00:06:08.396
Ray Stinger!

00:06:15.766 --> 00:06:17.196
Maro.

00:06:17.533 --> 00:06:18.533
Not bad.

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:20.170
That kid's strong.

00:06:20.566 --> 00:06:22.666
Damn it! So am I!

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:23.470
Shu?

00:06:25.700 --> 00:06:26.870
What are you planning to do?

00:06:27.266 --> 00:06:31.226
It's obvious. Blue Dragon
appeared with this before.

00:06:31.466 --> 00:06:33.866
I'm going to summon him with this!

00:06:36.033 --> 00:06:37.533
Come out! Shadow!

00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:38.870
Hey...

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:45.330
Come...out...

00:06:46.133 --> 00:06:47.133
No good, huh?

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:52.370
Damn!

00:06:57.333 --> 00:06:58.003
Maro?!

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:01.270
Uh-oh!

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:02.630
Run, Kluke!

00:07:12.133 --> 00:07:16.073
Squeeze-squeeze-squeeze-squeeze...

00:07:16.366 --> 00:07:17.966
You don't have much.

00:07:18.333 --> 00:07:20.433
Here you've got such a pretty face
and everything...

00:07:20.566 --> 00:07:22.466
There were lots of ladies in this town
who were pretty and had bigâ€”

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:25.130
Leave me alone!

00:07:31.433 --> 00:07:34.233
White, huh? You're boring.

00:07:34.266 --> 00:07:38.496
How about pink,
or turquoise, or lacey,

00:07:38.533 --> 00:07:40.973
- or with tulips and stuff...
- You little!

00:07:44.133 --> 00:07:45.603
You...little!

00:07:46.533 --> 00:07:49.333
Catch me if you can, maro.

00:07:50.466 --> 00:07:51.996
As you wish.

00:08:10.966 --> 00:08:11.626
Marumaro...

00:08:12.100 --> 00:08:12.770
Maro...

00:08:16.133 --> 00:08:17.173
- He ran away!
- He ran away!

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:19.170
Get him!

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:24.600
I'm gonna grab him by the neck
and beat him up!

00:08:24.833 --> 00:08:28.333
I'm not running away, maro!
It's a strategic retreat, maro!

00:08:28.366 --> 00:08:32.326
I'm gonna get you guys, maro!
Prepare yourselves, maro!

00:08:33.300 --> 00:08:37.270
- Who the heck was he?
- So annoying!

00:08:39.133 --> 00:08:41.103
Our stuff's gone!

00:08:51.566 --> 00:08:53.626
- What's with that kid?!
- What's with that kid?!

00:08:53.666 --> 00:08:55.226
That's my line.

00:08:55.466 --> 00:08:57.196
Why did you let our stuff
out of your sight?!

00:08:57.700 --> 00:09:01.470
It couldn't be helped!
I never thought it'd get stolen!

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:04.070
You're such an idiot, you loser!

00:09:04.100 --> 00:09:05.400
Say what?!

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:06.870
Say what?!

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:09.500
Chill out. This isn't the time
to be fighting.

00:09:11.433 --> 00:09:14.373
Anyway, we've got to
get our stuff back.

00:09:14.933 --> 00:09:17.273
He said something about
coming back.

00:09:17.866 --> 00:09:20.026
But still, he's too quick.

00:09:20.566 --> 00:09:24.266
I wonder if we can set a trap
to capture him.

00:09:24.733 --> 00:09:27.033
Then would you leave it to me?

00:09:28.166 --> 00:09:29.896
I've got a good idea.

00:09:32.633 --> 00:09:35.133
Hey, Kluke!
I've got a favor to ask.

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:41.900
What are you thinking, you idiot!

00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:43.800
Oww...

00:09:43.833 --> 00:09:46.633
Why should I have to do
something like that!

00:09:46.666 --> 00:09:50.126
We've got no choice, have we?
There's no other way.

00:09:50.166 --> 00:09:52.166
Then use yours.

00:09:52.333 --> 00:09:55.973
A man's won't work.

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:59.300
Like I care! I know that kid
is a pervert but!

00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:04.900
Listen Kluke, we need your cooperation
to capture him!

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:06.300
But...

00:10:06.333 --> 00:10:08.533
You don't wanna let him
get away with this, right?!

00:10:09.733 --> 00:10:12.733
Get mad!
You should get angry!

00:10:13.666 --> 00:10:15.626
You want to beat him, right?

00:10:16.333 --> 00:10:17.603
Y-Yeah...

00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:20.100
Then you'll do it, right?

00:10:44.933 --> 00:10:46.333
What's that?

00:10:46.366 --> 00:10:49.426
Isn't it obvious?
They're underwear!

00:10:49.466 --> 00:10:52.626
I know that. But why?

00:10:53.266 --> 00:10:56.366
He's a pervert and
has a thing for Kluke.

00:10:56.633 --> 00:11:00.803
In other words, her underwear
will be the best bait!

00:11:04.366 --> 00:11:06.126
Yeah, but why underwear?

00:11:06.500 --> 00:11:08.470
Because underwear are great!

00:11:08.833 --> 00:11:10.503
Underwear, huh?

00:11:10.766 --> 00:11:13.926
You two quit saying underwear!

00:11:15.366 --> 00:11:19.026
Listen! I'll punch you if you say
"underwear" one more time, okay?!

00:11:19.500 --> 00:11:21.130
You're saying it yourself.

00:11:21.333 --> 00:11:22.803
It's okay if I do!

00:11:23.266 --> 00:11:26.066
But I can't imagine he'd fall
for such an obvious trap.

00:11:29.266 --> 00:11:30.266
He fell for it.

00:11:30.533 --> 00:11:31.203
What?

00:11:31.266 --> 00:11:33.526
That was fast.
What's the deal with him?

00:11:35.033 --> 00:11:38.203
He's just after the underwear,
but he's being cautious.

00:11:39.933 --> 00:11:40.603
Be quiet!

00:11:48.166 --> 00:11:51.126
Underwear-underwear-
underwear-underwear...

00:11:51.166 --> 00:11:52.526
Whoa!

00:11:52.566 --> 00:11:55.066
What are you doing, maro?
Let me go, maro!

00:11:55.433 --> 00:11:56.873
Capture complete.

00:12:06.366 --> 00:12:08.096
You ready?!

00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:09.800
Give back our stuff!

00:12:09.900 --> 00:12:11.000
Maro.

00:12:11.033 --> 00:12:12.033
Hold on now.

00:12:12.333 --> 00:12:15.373
First, we need to clear up
the misunderstanding.

00:12:15.566 --> 00:12:17.966
That's right, maro!
No violence, maro!

00:12:18.200 --> 00:12:21.530
Don't get carried away!
What's your name?

00:12:22.033 --> 00:12:24.233
As I recall,
you're Maru...something.

00:12:24.466 --> 00:12:27.026
I don't have a name to
give to bad guys, maro!

00:12:27.366 --> 00:12:29.726
We're not bad guys!

00:12:29.900 --> 00:12:34.600
You are the bad guy
for stealing our stuff!

00:12:34.733 --> 00:12:36.203
Jeez.

00:12:36.666 --> 00:12:38.326
Tell us your name at least.

00:12:38.733 --> 00:12:40.703
I'm Marumaro.
Nice to meet you.

00:12:40.766 --> 00:12:43.366
- Why act so different!
- Why act so different!

00:12:43.533 --> 00:12:45.203
I hate men, maro!

00:12:45.233 --> 00:12:46.433
- What?!
- What?!

00:12:46.466 --> 00:12:48.226
Shut up, you two.

00:12:48.433 --> 00:12:49.933
You'll just make things
more complicated.

00:12:50.433 --> 00:12:53.873
Listen. We're not enemies.

00:12:54.066 --> 00:12:57.696
It was the forces of the Grankingdom
that destroyed this town.

00:12:57.966 --> 00:13:01.096
But you were with that robot, maro.

00:13:01.666 --> 00:13:02.926
I can't trust you, maro.

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:05.430
That's a misunderstanding!

00:13:05.466 --> 00:13:08.096
I'd believe it if you give me
your underwear.

00:13:10.366 --> 00:13:13.766
I'll give you as many punches
as you like!

00:13:15.200 --> 00:13:16.600
I'm scared, maro...

00:13:17.533 --> 00:13:19.003
This is getting us nowhere.

00:13:19.100 --> 00:13:21.970
Hey, you! In any case,
give us back our stuff!

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:25.600
And if you promise never to meddle
in our business ever again,

00:13:25.633 --> 00:13:27.233
I'll untie the rope!

00:13:27.366 --> 00:13:30.266
You guys are liars and
I can't trust you, maro!

00:13:31.333 --> 00:13:33.333
- You little!
- You little!

00:13:41.766 --> 00:13:43.226
Whoa...whoa...

00:13:43.766 --> 00:13:44.766
Hold it, maro.

00:13:45.033 --> 00:13:46.173
Calm down, maro.

00:13:51.633 --> 00:13:53.333
I apologize for tying you up.

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:57.200
However, you stole our stuff.

00:13:57.700 --> 00:13:58.830
That makes us even.

00:14:01.266 --> 00:14:04.326
Go before I change my mind.

00:14:04.666 --> 00:14:05.326
But!

00:14:05.433 --> 00:14:06.603
What about our stuff?

00:14:07.600 --> 00:14:08.830
- Oh!
- He ran away!

00:14:09.233 --> 00:14:10.233
That's okay.

00:14:10.900 --> 00:14:12.200
Whatever happens will happen.

00:14:18.866 --> 00:14:20.026
Those guys...

00:14:21.100 --> 00:14:22.600
What's the matter?

00:14:22.966 --> 00:14:24.696
You look lost.

00:14:24.833 --> 00:14:26.973
I-I'm not lost or anything, maro.

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:31.800
What is it, maro?

00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:33.970
I sense people coming.

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:35.600
There's a large number of them.

00:14:36.066 --> 00:14:36.726
Maro?

00:14:36.833 --> 00:14:37.833
That way!

00:14:48.866 --> 00:14:50.566
The girls from the town...

00:14:50.766 --> 00:14:54.026
It seems they weren't lying.

00:14:54.433 --> 00:14:56.803
These are the jerks that
attacked the town, maro?

00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:58.500
What's the plan?

00:14:58.933 --> 00:15:00.473
It's obvious, maro.

00:15:00.900 --> 00:15:04.770
We are defenders of justice, maro.

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:05.670
Right!

00:15:07.933 --> 00:15:10.403
What are we supposed to
do without our stuff?

00:15:10.500 --> 00:15:12.070
Our wallets were in there, right?

00:15:12.333 --> 00:15:15.403
Be quiet! It was your fault
to begin with.

00:15:15.433 --> 00:15:16.873
Say what?!

00:15:16.966 --> 00:15:18.096
What?

00:15:18.133 --> 00:15:19.533
- You wanna fight?!
- You wanna fight?!

00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:26.470
Isn't that the direction
that Marumaro kid went?

00:15:27.266 --> 00:15:27.926
Let's go.

00:15:29.866 --> 00:15:30.866
It's an enemy raid!

00:15:50.700 --> 00:15:51.370
Maro?

00:15:56.700 --> 00:15:58.430
Sir Ivanov! Sir Gustov!

00:15:58.733 --> 00:16:02.103
You guys stand down.
We'll handle him.

00:16:02.766 --> 00:16:04.526
We'll leave the transport
of the prisoners to you.

00:16:04.933 --> 00:16:05.933
Y-Yes, sir.

00:16:06.966 --> 00:16:08.326
Marumaro, be careful.

00:16:08.866 --> 00:16:09.526
Maro?

00:16:09.566 --> 00:16:10.566
They're Shadow Wielders!

00:16:10.933 --> 00:16:15.333
The Shadow... A special power
given to certain people.

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:20.600
However, there was one who made it
possible to extract that power artificially.

00:16:21.333 --> 00:16:22.503
And now...

00:16:22.533 --> 00:16:23.773
...we have the power!

00:16:35.533 --> 00:16:38.733
We'd wanted to fight
a natural Shadow Wielder.

00:16:39.166 --> 00:16:41.626
To demonstrate our power.

00:16:42.166 --> 00:16:44.326
Let's go, Saber Tiger!

00:16:44.366 --> 00:16:45.366
Right!

00:16:58.966 --> 00:17:02.366
You can't break our shield
with such power!

00:17:03.100 --> 00:17:05.430
I won't lose in speed!

00:17:09.300 --> 00:17:12.270
Blitz Claw!

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:20.700
Saber Tiger!

00:17:20.766 --> 00:17:23.196
Your speed and power
were pretty good,

00:17:23.366 --> 00:17:25.666
but I guess it wasn't good enough.

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:27.230
It's over!

00:17:33.533 --> 00:17:34.673
Let's go, Jiro!

00:17:36.866 --> 00:17:37.866
Roger!

00:17:37.933 --> 00:17:39.373
Wait a second!

00:17:39.400 --> 00:17:40.630
I'm going, too!

00:17:40.933 --> 00:17:41.973
I'm counting on you, Kluke!

00:17:42.333 --> 00:17:44.573
But he didn't appear earlier.

00:17:44.733 --> 00:17:47.903
I bet he appeared before
because you hit me!

00:17:48.066 --> 00:17:48.726
Huh?

00:17:48.800 --> 00:17:50.830
Do it just like that time!

00:17:51.133 --> 00:17:51.803
But...

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:54.500
Put your anger from before
into the frying pan!

00:17:54.733 --> 00:17:57.233
The power of underwear!
White underwear!

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:03.870
I said, stop saying underwear!

00:18:09.300 --> 00:18:11.370
Ouch...

00:18:12.600 --> 00:18:14.900
But... He's appeared!

00:18:17.800 --> 00:18:19.570
Oh... Did it hurt?

00:18:20.766 --> 00:18:22.726
You're going to help us, maro?

00:18:24.666 --> 00:18:25.666
New faces!

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:28.430
Four, huh? This might be trouble.

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:50.800
Move! Darn you!

00:18:52.166 --> 00:18:54.966
That's right. What are you doing,
Blue Dragon?!

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:56.730
Go!

00:18:58.166 --> 00:18:59.166
- Huh?
- Huh?

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:02.470
Don't be ordering me around!

00:19:12.366 --> 00:19:14.466
Shu! Don't be attacking carelessly!

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:16.630
I know, but...

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:18.500
There!

00:19:18.666 --> 00:19:19.666
Oh no!

00:19:19.933 --> 00:19:20.933
I don't think so!

00:19:23.533 --> 00:19:26.333
Saving your friend. How noble.

00:19:27.766 --> 00:19:30.496
What about your friend over here?!

00:19:36.100 --> 00:19:37.100
Kluke!

00:19:48.933 --> 00:19:49.933
Marumaro!

00:19:50.033 --> 00:19:52.803
It's not nice to hurt girls, maro!

00:19:53.833 --> 00:19:54.933
We are defenders of justice.

00:19:55.133 --> 00:19:57.003
Helping people is what we do.

00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:01.470
A Grankingdom ship!

00:20:01.933 --> 00:20:03.173
We won't let them get away!

00:20:03.200 --> 00:20:06.130
Shu! The townspeople
are on that ship!

00:20:06.333 --> 00:20:07.003
Oh...

00:20:11.133 --> 00:20:12.933
Hornet Pierce!

00:20:20.033 --> 00:20:21.503
It seems they've departed.

00:20:22.266 --> 00:20:23.966
Our mission is over.

00:20:24.266 --> 00:20:28.426
Now what should we do until we report
to General Logi at two o'clock?

00:20:29.966 --> 00:20:32.526
It's not wise to make
General Logi angry.

00:20:34.466 --> 00:20:37.566
Besides, we can beat
these guys anytime.

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:39.100
Then it's settled.

00:20:39.633 --> 00:20:41.433
- Prosper Wall!
- Prosper Wall!

00:21:09.300 --> 00:21:10.330
Did they run away?

00:21:10.766 --> 00:21:11.426
No.

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:15.170
We should probably say
that they let us go.

00:21:24.633 --> 00:21:26.973
I'm sorry I took your stuff, maro.

00:21:27.400 --> 00:21:29.200
I was hungry and couldn't help it.

00:21:29.966 --> 00:21:31.066
I'm sorry, maro.

00:21:31.333 --> 00:21:32.733
No more pranks!

00:21:33.433 --> 00:21:36.903
There might be enemies nearby,
so be careful!

00:21:37.433 --> 00:21:41.303
Girls will hate you if you don't stop
being such a pervert.

00:21:43.500 --> 00:21:45.730
Let's get going. We're off.

